            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3002",
            "content": {
                "en": "What? I'm... back here again?",
                "zh": "什么？我又......回到了这里？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1026.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2ab92309-2bfc-4f88-a564-e2b0f3c7f789",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3003",
            "content": {
                "en": "The lights are on, and everyone else seems normal.",
                "zh": "灯光亮着，其他人看上去也很正常。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1378.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6b724af7-8bf3-463e-8446-6d79cc6a90a9",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3004",
            "content": {
                "en": "Just like the last two times. So every time I die... I return to this moment?",
                "zh": "和前两次一样。只要我死去......就会回到这个时间点？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1738.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 722.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
